<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - Totats Skin Art Tattoo</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/aboutpublic.css">
</head>

<body>

    <header class="navbar">
        <a class="logo" href="/landingpage">
            <img src="/images/TotatsSkinArtTattoo.jpg" alt="Totats Skin Art Tattoo logo">
            <span class="brand">Totats <span>Skin Art Tattoo</span></span>
        </a>

        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a class="back-link" href="/landingpage">&#8592; Back to Landing Page</a></li>
        </ul>
    </header>

    <main class="about-container">

        <section class="about-hero">
            <h1>About Us</h1>
            <p>
                Welcome to Tattoo Home-Based Management System,
                a convenient platform designed to make tattoo
                appointment management simple and organized.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-content">

            <article class="about-card">
                <h2>Our Purpose</h2>
                <p>
                    Our purpose is to provide clients with an easier way
                    to schedule tattoo appointments while helping tattoo
                    artists manage their schedules and client information
                    efficiently.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="about-card">
                <h2>What We Offer</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Easy appointment scheduling</li>
                    <li>Tattoo photo gallery</li>
                    <li>Free ointment cream</li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            <article class="about-card">
                <h2>Our Goal</h2>
                <p>
                    Our goal is to provide a reliable and user-friendly
                    management system that improves the efficiency of
                    home-based tattoo services and creates a convenient
                    experience for both clients and tattoo artists.
                </p>
            </article>

        </section>

        <section class="contact-section">

            <h2>Get In Touch</h2>

            <p>
                For appointments, inquiries, or additional information,
                please contact our tattoo service.
            </p>

            <address>
                Blk 8 Lot 4 James Street, Sarmiento Townville<br>
                City of San Jose del Monte, Bulacan
            </address>

            <div class="contact-info">
                <span>Contact Us</span>
                <span>Email Us</span>
                <span>Totats Skin Art Tattoo</span>
                <span>Facebook</span>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer class="foot">
        © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Totats Skin Art Tattoo · San Jose del Monte, Bulacan
    </footer>

